 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A tetrahedral mesh defined by vertices and cell connectivity [G].
-*   **Output:** A rendered image with accumulated color and opacity [G].
+* **Input:** A tetrahedral mesh defined by vertices and cell connectivity [G].
